[2026-07-20T08:26:23.611Z] [INFO]           "+  # new PR. This job runs the *same* code path over the PR's own commits so a",
[2026-07-20T08:26:23.611Z] [INFO]           "+  # violating commit is rejected before it can break a release.",
[2026-07-20T08:26:23.611Z] [INFO]           "+  evidence-check:",
[2026-07-20T08:26:23.611Z] [INFO]           "+    name: Self-Hosting Evidence Check",
