[2026-07-20T08:34:24.437Z] [INFO]         "content": "436\t\n437\t      # Attest before publishing, not after: uploading first left the assets\n438\t      # downloadable for the length of the attest step, and permanently so if\n439\t      # attest failed, with `gh attestation verify` unable to vouch for them.\n440\t      - name: Attest build provenance\n441\t        uses: actions/attest@v4\n442\t        with:\n443\t          # The released v4 checksum parser splits with the runner's native EOL,\n444\t          # so it treats our intentionally portable LF manifest as one record on\n445\t          # Windows. Digest the artifacts directly; keep the checksum fragment\n446\t          # solely for the consolidated, user-facing SHA256SUMS.txt.\n447\t          subject-path: |\n448\t            desktop/release/formal-ai-desktop-*\n449\t            desktop/release/latest*.yml\n450\t\n451\t      - name: Upload assets to release\n452\t        working-directory: desktop\n453\t        env:\n454\t          GH_TOKEN: ${{ github.token }}\n455\t          REPO: ${{ github.repository }}\n456\t          TAG: ${{ needs.resolve.outputs.tag }}\n457\t        run: |\n458\t          set -euo pipefail\n459\t          files=()\n460\t          for f in release/formal-ai-desktop-*; do\n461\t            case \"$f\" in\n462\t              *.dmg|*.zip|*.exe|*.AppImage|*.deb|*.tar.gz|*.blockmap) files+=(\"$f\") ;;\n463\t            esac\n464\t          done\n465\t          for f in release/latest.yml release/latest-mac.yml release/latest-linux.yml; do\n466\t            [ -f \"$f\" ] && files+=(\"$f\")\n467\t          done\n468\t          gh release upload \"$TAG\" \"${files[@]}\" --repo \"$REPO\" --clobber\n469\t\n470\t      - name: Upload checksum fragment\n471\t        uses: actions/upload-artifact@v7\n472\t        with:\n473\t          name: checksums-${{ matrix.label }}\n474\t          path: desktop/release/SHA256SUMS-${{ matrix.label }}.partial\n475\t          retention-days: 7\n476\t\n477\t  vscode:\n478\t    name: Package VS Code extension (.vsix)\n479\t    needs: resolve\n480\t    if: needs.resolve.outputs.should_build == 'true'\n481\t    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n482\t    timeout-minutes: 15\n483\t    permissions:\n484\t      contents: write\n485\t      id-token: write"
