[2026-07-20T09:21:00.213Z] [INFO]           "new_string": "          MACOS_ADHOC_SIGN: \"1\"\n          # Issue #808: electron-builder's isSignAllowed() bails out with\n          # \"Current build is a part of pull request, code signing will be\n          # skipped\" whenever GITHUB_BASE_REF is set (builder-util\n          # `isPullRequest()`), so the pull-request dry run produced an unsigned\n          # .app with no CodeResources and the smoke test failed. The security\n          # warning attached to this flag is about *secret* certificates leaking\n          # to fork builds; this step only runs when no signing secrets exist and\n          # signs ad-hoc with identity `-`, so there is nothing to leak.\n          CSC_FOR_PULL_REQUEST: \"true\"\n          FORMAL_AI_MACOS_SIGN_DEBUG: \"1\""
